Terror Drones animate while moving again.

The Terror Drone rides the infantry path in the sim (its combat has
is_vehicle/is_aircraft/is_naval all false, because the voxel loader cannot
load its SHP art), but it draws through the SHP-vehicle frame rule
(W2-GA-11). pres_walk_tick only advanced the walk stage for vehicle,
aircraft and naval units, so the drone's WalkedFramesSoFar stage stayed 0
and shp_vehicle_frame picked the same first walk frame every draw -- the
drone glided without animating. The tick now also covers units in the
SHP-vehicle draw set, via a small tested predicate
(unit_advances_walk_stage) and a main.cpp lookup over g_shp_vehicles.
Render-only: the sim, save format and network traffic are untouched.

--- a/engine/present_motion.hpp
