+// 0265: whether a unit's walk animation advances (the W3-B WalkedFramesSoFar
+// stage that steps SHP-vehicle walk frames and voxel HVA frames). SHP-drawn
+// vehicles (W2-GA-11: artmd Voxel=no, e.g. DRON/DLPH/SQD) animate by that
+// stage whatever the sim's vehicle flags say -- the Terror Drone rides the
+// infantry path in the sim (combat is_vehicle=false) but draws SHP frames,
+// so without `shp_vehicle` its walk stage stayed 0 and it never stepped out
+// of its first frame while moving. Purely presentational: the sim is untouched.
+inline bool unit_advances_walk_stage(const Unit& u, bool shp_vehicle) {
+    if (!u.alive || u.die_time >= 0.0) return false;
+    return u.is_vehicle || u.is_aircraft || u.is_naval || shp_vehicle;
+}
